OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry        
OL,6,Fevening with patchy cloud and some     
OL,7,Flong clear spells. Overnight a few     
OL,8,Fshowers will start to drift in from    
OL,9,Fthe North Sea on freshening            
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly winds.                   
OL,12,CTuesday:FSunny intervals and showers   
OL,13,Fon Tuesday. Thicker cloud will bring   
OL,14,Fmore general rain to Orkney later.     
OL,15,FFresh to strong southeasterly winds.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
